        "node_id": "n_4_c26ae3",
        "thought_text": "Thought-2: Ensure Proper Initialization and Transition in DP Table\n\nThe issue might stem from improper initialization or the transition formula not being applied correctly. Ensure that the base case `dp[0][0] = 1` is correctly set up and that the transition formula `dp[i][j] = (dp[i-1][j] + dp[i-j][j-1] * (prefix_sum[i] - prefix_sum[i-j])) % MOD` is implemented accurately within the nested loops. Double-check that the indices used in the transition formula match the intended values and that the modulo operation is applied consistently throughout the calculations.",
